{"id":99,"name":"الزلزلة","transliteration":"Az-Zalzalah","translation_fr":"Le séisme","translation_en":"The Earthquake","type":"medinan","total_verses":8,"verses":[{"id":1,"text":"إِذَا زُلۡزِلَتِ ٱلۡأَرۡضُ زِلۡزَالَهَا","translation_fr":"Quand la terre tremblera d'un violent tremblement","translation_en":"When the earth is shaken with its [final] earthquake","transliteration":"Itha zulzilati alardu zilzalaha"},{"id":2,"text":"وَأَخۡرَجَتِ ٱلۡأَرۡضُ أَثۡقَالَهَا","translation_fr":"et que la terre fera sortir ses fardeaux","translation_en":"And the earth discharges its burdens","transliteration":"Waakhrajati alardu athqalaha"},{"id":3,"text":"وَقَالَ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ مَا لَهَا","translation_fr":"et que l'homme dira: «Qu'a-t-elle?»","translation_en":"And man says, \"What is [wrong] with it","transliteration":"Waqala alinsanu ma laha"},{"id":4,"text":"يَوۡمَئِذٖ تُحَدِّثُ أَخۡبَارَهَا","translation_fr":"ce jour-là, elle contera son histoire","translation_en":"That Day, it will report its news","transliteration":"Yawmaithin tuhaddithu akhbaraha"},{"id":5,"text":"بِأَنَّ رَبَّكَ أَوۡحَىٰ لَهَا","translation_fr":"selon ce que ton Seigneur lui aura révélé [ordonné]","translation_en":"Because your Lord has commanded it","transliteration":"Bianna rabbaka awha laha"},{"id":6,"text":"يَوۡمَئِذٖ يَصۡدُرُ ٱلنَّاسُ أَشۡتَاتٗا لِّيُرَوۡاْ أَعۡمَٰلَهُمۡ","translation_fr":"Ce jour-là, les gens sortiront séparément pour que leur soient montrées leurs œuvres","translation_en":"That Day, the people will depart separated [into categories] to be shown [the result of] their deeds","transliteration":"Yawmaithin yasduru alnnasu ashtatan liyuraw aAAmalahum"},{"id":7,"text":"فَمَن يَعۡمَلۡ مِثۡقَالَ ذَرَّةٍ خَيۡرٗا يَرَهُۥ","translation_fr":"Quiconque fait un bien fût-ce du poids d'un atome, le verra","translation_en":"So whoever does an atom's weight of good will see it","transliteration":"Faman yaAAmal mithqala tharratin khayran yarahu"},{"id":8,"text":"وَمَن يَعۡمَلۡ مِثۡقَالَ ذَرَّةٖ شَرّٗا يَرَهُۥ","translation_fr":"et quiconque fait un mal fût-ce du poids d'un atome, le verra","translation_en":"And whoever does an atom's weight of evil will see it","transliteration":"Waman yaAAmal mithqala tharratin sharran yarahu"}]}